  "— The First Letter of the Living —": "— La Primera Letra de los Vivientes —",
  "— You walk on into the night —": "— Seguís caminando hacia la noche —",
  "\"...Who are you?\"": "«...¿Quién sois?»",
  "\"A fitting lesson for this night.\"": "«Una enseñanza apropiada para esta noche.»",
  "\"A pledge before God must be honoured.\"": "«Un voto hecho ante Dios debe ser honrado.»",
  "\"A question that has become a road.\"": "«Una pregunta que se ha tornado camino.»",
