  "\"Only browsing today. Forgive me.\"": "«Hoy sólo miro. Perdonadme.»",
  "\"Only tell me where the quiet lanes begin.\"": "«Decidme sólo dónde comienzan las callejas sosegadas.»",
  "\"Only the house where courtesy still keeps a lamp lit.\"": "«Sólo la casa donde la cortesía aún mantiene encendida una lámpara.»",
  "\"Only to pray. Forgive the intrusion.\"": "«Sólo para orar. Perdonad la intrusión.»",
  "\"Peace be upon this household.\"": "«La paz sea sobre esta casa.»",
  "\"Peace be upon you. I would be grateful.\"": "«La paz sea con vos. Os quedaría agradecido.»",
  "\"Peace be with you.\"": "«La paz sea con vos.»",
  "\"Perhaps the name is already on the road.\"": "«Quizá el nombre ya esté en el camino.»",
  "\"Pray for the travellers.\"": "«Orad por los viajeros.»",
  "\"Speak your plea to Him plainly.\"": "«Exponedle vuestra súplica con llaneza.»",
  "\"Teach me what this sign means.\"": "«Enseñadme qué significa esta señal.»",
  "\"Tell me only what you know, not what rumour adds.\"": "«Decidme sólo lo que sabéis, no lo que añade el rumor.»",
  "\"Tell me what befell him.\"": "«Decidme qué le aconteció.»",
  "\"Thank you for the warning.\"": "«Gracias por la advertencia.»",
  "\"Thank you. I will look for them.\"": "«Gracias. Los buscaré.»",
  "\"Thank you. May God bless your trade.\"": "«Gracias. Que Dios bendiga vuestro comercio.»",
  "\"Thank you. Peace be with you.\"": "«Gracias. La paz sea con vos.»",
  "\"Thank you. Your witness is precious.\"": "«Gracias. Vuestro testimonio es precioso.»",
  "\"The road itself has become a witness.\"": "«El camino mismo se ha convertido en testigo.»",
  "\"The young Siyyid whose name is spoken in the bazaar.\"": "«El joven Siyyid cuyo nombre se pronuncia en el bazar.»",
  "\"Then ask me, and I will answer as honestly as I can.\"": "«Entonces preguntadme, y responderé con toda la honestidad de que sea capaz.»",
  "\"Then Chihríq is not an ending.\"": "«Entonces Chihríq no es término.»",
  "\"Then I will weigh my words.\"": "«Entonces pesaré mis palabras.»",
  "\"Then may I not sleep through it.\"": "«Entonces, que no duerma yo mientras acontece.»",
  "\"Then reconciliation must tell the truth plainly.\"": "«Entonces la reconciliación ha de decir la verdad con llaneza.»",
  "\"Then ride before the day grows hot.\"": "«Entonces cabalgad antes de que el día cobre calor.»",
  "\"Then speak his name, and I will remember.\"": "«Entonces pronunciad su nombre, y yo recordaré.»",
  "\"Then the friends need both firmness and tenderness.\"": "«Entonces los amigos precisan tanto firmeza como ternura.»",
  "\"Then this is proclamation, not provocation.\"": "«Entonces esto es proclamación, no provocación.»",
  "\"Then your courage is noted.\"": "«Entonces queda consignado vuestro valor.»",
  "\"These chains speak before any judge does.\"": "«Estas cadenas hablan antes que cualquier juez.»",
  "\"This is a grave claim. Prove it — reveal a commentary upon the Súrih of Joseph, unbidden.\"": "«Ésta es una pretensión grave. Probadla: revelad, sin que se os pida, un comentario sobre la Súrih de José.»",
  "\"This rain has washed too many promises into mud.\"": "«Esta lluvia ha arrastrado demasiadas promesas al lodo.»",
  "\"This shocks me, yet I will listen before I judge.\"": "«Esto me sobrecoge; con todo, escucharé antes de juzgar.»",
  "\"This… is the proof I sought. I bear witness.\"": "«Esto… es la prueba que buscaba. Doy testimonio.»",
  "\"Understood. Peace be with you.\"": "«Entendido. La paz sea con vos.»",
  "\"Walk south with a pure heart. Shíráz will answer better than I can.\"": "«Caminad hacia el sur con corazón puro. Shíráz responderá mejor que yo.»",
  "\"We seek only to understand what has happened.\"": "«Sólo procuramos comprender lo que ha acontecido.»",
  "\"What crime has been proved?\"": "«¿Qué crimen ha sido probado?»",
  "\"What did you see that others refused to see?\"": "«¿Qué visteis que otros rehusaron ver?»",
  "\"What does He say in the darkness?\"": "«¿Qué dice Él en la oscuridad?»",
  "\"What have you heard of the young Siyyid?\"": "«¿Qué habéis oído del joven Siyyid?»",
  "\"What news travels with the caravans?\"": "«¿Qué nuevas viajan con las caravanas?»",
  "\"What restraint He shows before those who confine Him.\"": "«Qué templanza muestra Él ante quienes lo confinan.»",
  "\"What should I carry to the gate?\"": "«¿Qué debo llevar a la puerta?»",
