  "\"Why does a merchant trouble the governor?\"": "«¿Por qué un mercader inquieta al gobernador?»",
  "\"You risk much by offering Him sanctuary.\"": "«Mucho arriesgáis al ofrecerle santuario.»",
  "\"You speak as a believer.\"": "«Habláis como creyente.»",
  "\"You speak with the courage of one who knows her hour.\"": "«Habláis con el valor de quien conoce su hora.»",
  "\"Your warning is received.\"": "«Vuestra advertencia ha sido recibida.»",
